# IOES - Intelligent Online Examination System

## Project Overview
- **Name:** IOES (Intelligent Online Examination System)
- **Type:** Microservices-based online examination platform
- **Architecture:** Monorepo with Nx, 10 Backend Microservices + Frontend
- **Stack:** React 18 + TypeScript, Java 17 Spring Boot 3, Node.js 20 NestJS, Python 3.11 FastAPI

